        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong> :<br>Inferis: Dead Below is a first-person psychological horror and walking simulator experience, offering approximately 45 to 50 minutes of intense gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.poster.avif?t=1761312981\" width=1600 height=866 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.webm?t=1761312981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.mp4?t=1761312981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story Overview:</strong><br> Journalist Larry descends into the underground tunnels, following the pleas of families who haven’t heard from their missing loved ones for a long time. Initially setting out to fulfill his duty as a reporter, Larry is soon pulled into a nightmare that tests both his mental and physical limits. As the line between reality and hallucination blurs, he finds himself edging closer to a dark secret that no human mind should ever uncover. The journey becomes not only a mission to uncover the truth—but a fight to save his own soul.<br><br>Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immersive First-Person Experience:</i> Step into the darkness through Larry’s eyes and explore a terrifying underground world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Psychological Horror:</i> A unique narrative where the boundaries of reality blur and mental collapse feels imminent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Atmospheric Sound Design:</i> High-quality audio and ambient effects that keep players on edge at all times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Heavy and Claustrophobic Atmosphere:</i> A tension-filled world shaped by fear of tight spaces and the unknown.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong> :<br>Inferis: Dead Below is a first-person psychological horror and walking simulator experience, offering approximately 45 to 50 minutes of intense gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.poster.avif?t=1761312981\" width=1600 height=866 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.webm?t=1761312981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919230/extras/fd06882cabc49ad58ec7e3c9cfd09f02.mp4?t=1761312981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story Overview:</strong><br> Journalist Larry descends into the underground tunnels, following the pleas of families who haven’t heard from their missing loved ones for a long time. Initially setting out to fulfill his duty as a reporter, Larry is soon pulled into a nightmare that tests both his mental and physical limits. As the line between reality and hallucination blurs, he finds himself edging closer to a dark secret that no human mind should ever uncover. The journey becomes not only a mission to uncover the truth—but a fight to save his own soul.<br><br>Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immersive First-Person Experience:</i> Step into the darkness through Larry’s eyes and explore a terrifying underground world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Psychological Horror:</i> A unique narrative where the boundaries of reality blur and mental collapse feels imminent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Atmospheric Sound Design:</i> High-quality audio and ambient effects that keep players on edge at all times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Heavy and Claustrophobic Atmosphere:</i> A tension-filled world shaped by fear of tight spaces and the unknown.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "You're a journalist searching for answers... but beneath the surface lies only terror. The labyrinth you’ve entered to find the missing may never let you leave.",
